{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":18,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["关于古实的预言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["古实河那边、翅膀刷刷作响之地有祸了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"那里派出的使节乘芦苇船行驶在水面上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迅捷的使节啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去身材高大、皮肤光滑、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远近畏惧、强悍好战、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内河流纵横的民族那里吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"天下万民啊，普世的居民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山上竖立旗帜的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要看；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"号角吹响的时候，你们要听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我要从我的居所静静地观看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无声无息，就像烈日下闪烁的热气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如夏收时节露水蒸发的云雾。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在收割之前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"花已凋谢、葡萄将熟之时，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必用刀削去葡萄树的嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砍掉蔓延的枝条。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必全部被抛给山野间的鸷鸟和走兽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夏天被鸷鸟啄食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"冬天被走兽吞吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"那时，这身材高大、皮肤光滑、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"远近畏惧、强悍好战、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"境内河流纵横的民族，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必带着礼物来到锡安山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之耶和华立名之地。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/18.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/19.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/17.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}